@startuml
' Activity Diagram - Tracking & Notifications (SHORT)
skinparam swimlaneOrientation vertical

title Activity - Tracking & Notifications (SHORT) (UC-D6)

|System|
start
:Receive order status change;
:Validate lifecycle step [BR-7];

if (Transition valid?) then (Yes)
  :Update order status;
  :Publish status update event;

  :Notify restaurant of status;
  |Restaurant|
  :See order status update;

  |System|
  :Notify shipper of status;
  |Shipper|
  :See delivery status update;

  |Customer|
  if (App is active?) then (Yes)
    |System|
    :Send real-time update;
    |External Systems (WebSocket)|
    :Deliver WebSocket message;
    |System|
    if (WebSocket delivered?) then (Yes)
      |Customer|
      :See live status update;
    else (No)
      |External Systems (FCM / Push)|
      :Send push notification;
      |Customer|
      :Open app to view status;
    endif
  else (No)
    |External Systems (FCM / Push)|
    :Send push notification;
    |Customer|
    :Open app to view status;
  endif

  |System|
  if (Updates delayed?) then (Yes)
    |Customer|
    :Use status polling view;
  endif
  stop

else (No)
  :Reject invalid transition;
  stop
endif
@enduml
